  id: unlisted-operator
  title: Unlisted Operator
  description: Find the signed dispatches behind a technician who appears in payroll but in no identity register.
  company: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0b1df930f3d88d84c9187b8fa3762df7, type: 2}
  network: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2c2c704342b26c540acc14fea0d5617c, type: 2}
  client: MOTH / unverified relay
  tag: RECONSTRUCT / VESPER
  objective: Recover signed clue at Authoritative record / Recover signed clue at Signed dispatch record / Recover signed clue at Credential witness
  condition: All required objectives must be secured. Optional archives pay extra. Quiet bonus uses peak trace.
  aftermath: The technician was real. Their identity was removed after they refused an emergency rehearsal.
