  - id: unlisted-operator/0
    title: Unlisted Operator / Unsent message
    company:
    contract: Unlisted Operator
    text: 'MOTH / unverified relay: Find the signed dispatches behind a technician who appears in payroll but in no identity register. The sender asks you to keep the names attached to the evidence; anonymous totals have concealed people before.'
  - id: unlisted-operator/1
    title: Unlisted Operator / Custody note
    company:
    contract: Unlisted Operator
    text: 'Archive custody, Unlisted Operator: The technician was real. Their identity was removed after they refused an emergency rehearsal. A second copy carries a hand-written objection to the official disposition.'
